D-019 terminal safety correction — closed-editor validation
Date: 2026-09-01
Implementation commit: 95573a3

Behavioral contract
- Arena events are evaluated only while a verified timed-gate episode is recording.
- Physics callbacks before one authoritative observation are coalesced into one collision event.
- A terminal event freezes schedule/event tracking but retains physical gate collision.
- The terminal observation is recorded under the action that caused it.
- The bridge then clears both local- and world-frame desired-velocity requests exactly once.
- Command echo validation is deferred until the zero request is actually produced.
- A successful arena reset re-arms terminal safe-stop behavior.

